{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>וכמוהו (\"and like it\")</b> — twice in the Masorah: וכמוהו לא תוסיף, and וכמוהו לא היה לפניו, in the passage about Josiah — to teach that after him as well none arose like him, as written here: וכמוהו לא תוסיף."], :book :exodus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 11, :notes {0 "The two Masorah citations are from Exodus 11:6 (וכמוהו לא תוסיף) and 2 Kings 23:25 (וכמוהו לא היה לפניו), the latter referring to Josiah; the argument pairs them so that the Exodus superlative also implies none after, as stated of Josiah."}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:12:29.258583959Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}